# Project We Backend

## Run locally

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows: .venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
pip install -e ".[dev]"
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

## Test

```bash
pytest
```

## Lint

```bash
ruff check .
```
